{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1427215","title":"Metagenomic and metatranscriptomic insights into microbial community and nitrogen metabolism in an Anammox-dominated biofilm reactor","description":"This project aims to: (1) investigate the microbial community succession during the enrichment process; (2) reconstruct high-quality metagenome-assembled genomes (MAGs) of key functional populations, including AnAOB, ammonia-oxidizing bacteria (AOB), and denitrifiers; (3) elucidate the metabolic pathways responsible for nitrogen removal, with a focus on the coupling between partial nitrification, endogenous denitratation, and Anammox; and (4) link gene expression patterns to reactor performance via metatranscriptomic analysis. This dataset provides valuable genomic resources for understanding AnAOB ecology and the metabolic interactions within a self-sustaining nitrogen-removing consortium. It supports the development of simplified, energy-saving wastewater treatment processes.","center":"Hainan University","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/02/23 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN55907234","MIMARKS Survey related sample from wastewater metagenome","non_environmental",null,"2025-08-21",2025,"CN","Hainan",1809078,"Haikou","probable",20.04,110.19,"China: Hainan",null,"Aquatic","Laboratory bioreactor","Activated sludge","laboratory or culture material"],["SAMN55907235","MIMARKS Survey related sample from wastewater metagenome","non_environmental",null,"2025-09-14",2025,"CN","Hainan",1809078,"Haikou","probable",20.04,110.19,"China: Hainan",null,"Aquatic","Laboratory bioreactor","Activated sludge","laboratory or culture material"],["SAMN55907236","MIMARKS Survey related sample from wastewater metagenome","non